    "title": "Senior Fleet Manager at Mahindra Navistar",
    "description": "If you're a passionate Fleet Manager with drive and ambition, Mahindra Navistar in Pimpri-Chinchwad is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout Mahindra Navistar:\nMahindra Navistar is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n• Ensure compliance with transportation regulations and safety standards\n• Coordinate with customer service teams to resolve delivery issues\n• Manage relationships with third-party logistics providers\n• Implement cost-saving initiatives in transportation and warehousing\n• Oversee end-to-end logistics operations for timely delivery\n• Manage a fleet of vehicles and coordinate with drivers\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Bachelor's degree in a relevant field\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in Fleet Management\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n• Proficiency in 3PL Management\n• Proficiency in GPS Tracking Systems\n• Proficiency in Last Mile Delivery\n• Proficiency in KPI Monitoring\n• Proficiency in SAP SCM\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Pimpri-Chinchwad, Maharashtra, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Mahindra Navistar!",
